# 7. Declaring wires
### 문제
wire를 본문에 선언
![](https://velog.velcdn.com/images/courage_hw/post/fe00ebb4-fb68-48fa-ab54-3c8daa86561f/image.png)


### 코드
```verilog
module top_module(
    input a,
    input b,
    input c,
    input d,
    output out,
    output out_n   ); 
    
	wire w1, w2; // w1과 w2 wire선언
    
    assign w1 = a & b;
    assign w2 = c & d;
    
    assign out = w1 | w2;
    assign out_n = ~(w1 | w2);
    
endmodule
```
