# 8. 7458 chip
### 문제
7458은 4개의 AND 게이트와 2개의 OR 게이트가 있는 칩입니다
![](https://velog.velcdn.com/images/courage_hw/post/a7ed8999-f1fd-41dd-87de-d6a6ce43216c/image.png)


### 코드
```verilog
module top_module ( 
    input p1a, p1b, p1c, p1d, p1e, p1f,
    output p1y,
    input p2a, p2b, p2c, p2d,
    output p2y );

	// 방법 1. 한번에 선언
    assign p1y = (p1a & p1b & p1c) | (p1d & p1e & p1f);
    assign p2y = (p2a & p2b) | (p2c & p2d);
    
    // 방법 2. wire를 선언
    wire w1, w2, w3, w4;
    assign w1 = p1a & p1b & p1c;
    assign w2 = p1d & p1e & p1f;
    assign p1y = w1 | w2;
    
    assign w3 = p2a & p2b;
    assign w4 = p2c & p2d;
    assign p2y = w3 | w4;

endmodule
```
